---
/**
 * Direct donation block. Renders nothing while DONATION_ADDRESS is empty.
 *
 * No wallet-connect library and no third-party script: an address, a copy button and a link that
 * opens the wallet. /legal promises no third-party requests, and a donation button is not a
 * reason to break that promise. It also means this works with MetaMask, Rabby, Coinbase Wallet
 * or a phone camera without us knowing who donated — which is the point.
 */
import { DONATION_ADDRESS, DONATION_CHAINS, donationLink } from '../donation';
import type { Lang } from '../i18n';

interface Props { lang: Lang }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const es = lang === 'es';
const address = DONATION_ADDRESS;
const qr = `/donation-qr.svg`;
---
{address && (
  <section class="donate">
    <h2>{es ? 'Donar directamente' : 'Donate directly'}</h2>
    <p>
      {es
        ? 'Si PediBot te ha sido útil y quieres echar una mano con lo que cuesta mantenerlo, puedes enviar lo que quieras a esta dirección. No hace falta cuenta ni registro, y no cambia nada: nada de PediBot está cerrado ni lo estará.'
        : 'If PediBot has been useful and you want to help with what it costs to run, you can send whatever you like to this address. No account, no sign-up, and it changes nothing: nothing here is gated and nothing ever will be.'}
    </p>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="qr"><img src={qr} alt={es ? 'Código QR de la dirección de donación' : 'QR code of the donation address'} width="132" height="132" loading="lazy" /></div>
      <div class="addr">
        <p class="net">{es ? 'La misma dirección en:' : 'The same address on:'}</p>
        <p class="nets">
          {DONATION_CHAINS.map((c) => (
            <span class={c.recommended ? 'net-tag best' : 'net-tag'}>
              {c.name} <i>{c.coin}</i>{c.recommended ? (es ? ' · la más barata' : ' · cheapest') : ''}
            </span>
          ))}
        </p>
        <code class="mono" id="donate-addr">{address}</code>
        <p class="row">
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="donate-copy" type="button">{es ? 'Copiar dirección' : 'Copy address'}</button>
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href={donationLink(address)}>{es ? 'Abrir en la cartera (Base)' : 'Open in wallet (Base)'}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="fine">
      {es
        ? 'Es la misma dirección en todas esas redes: elige la que ya uses, y si te da igual, Base es la más barata. Envía solo desde una de ellas — si mandas desde una red que no es EVM (USDC en Solana o en Tron, por ejemplo), el dinero se pierde y no hay forma de recuperarlo. Todo lo que entra queda escrito en la cadena y cualquiera puede verlo. Una donación no es una consulta médica ni da acceso a nada distinto.'
        : 'It is the same address on all of those networks: pick the one you already use, and if you have no preference, Base is the cheapest. Send from one of them only — money sent over a network that is not EVM (USDC on Solana or Tron, say) is lost with no way back. Everything it receives is written on-chain and anyone can look. A donation is not a medical consultation and buys no different access.'}
    </p>
  </section>
)}

{address && (
  <script is:inline define:vars={{ address, copied: es ? '¡Copiada!' : 'Copied!' }}>
    document.getElementById('donate-copy')?.addEventListener('click', async (e) => {
      const b = e.currentTarget;
      const old = b.textContent;
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(address);
      } catch (err) {
        const r = document.createRange();
        r.selectNode(document.getElementById('donate-addr'));
        getSelection()?.removeAllRanges();
        getSelection()?.addRange(r);
      }
      b.textContent = copied;
      setTimeout(() => { b.textContent = old; }, 1600);
    });
  </script>
)}

<style>
  .donate { margin-top: 34px; }
  .donate .card {
    display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;
    background: var(--cream); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px 18px;
  }
  .donate .qr { background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 6px; line-height: 0; }
  .donate .addr { flex: 1 1 260px; min-width: 0; }
  .donate .net { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: .82rem; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .donate .nets { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .donate .net-tag {
    font-size: .78rem; color: var(--ink-2); background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 9px;
  }
  .donate .net-tag.best { border-color: var(--sage); color: var(--sage); }
  .donate .net-tag i { font-style: normal; opacity: .6; }
  .donate code {
    display: block; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: .86rem;
    background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 10px;
  }
  .donate .row { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 10px 0 0; }
  .donate .fine { font-size: .84rem; color: var(--ink-3); margin-top: 12px; }
</style>
